{\normalsize\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\itshape\normalsize\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.2cm}
\begin{minipage}{5in}
\setlength{\parskip}{0.15em}
\footnotesize\color{CoverCream}
本書逐章研讀腓立比書四章，整合老弟兄查經方法論、
John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan 屬靈組織分析，
以「φρονέω」（存這樣的心思）一詞貫穿全書：
原則（1:21 活着就是基督）、目的（2:5-11 基督的心）、
竭力向前（3:12-14 向着標竿直跑）、追求（4:8-9 凡是真實的都要思念）。

{\color{CoverCream}A chapter-by-chapter study of all four chapters of Philippians, integrating the Thursday Bible class method, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition, and G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis --- traced through Paul's own key word, {\itshape phroneō} (“to have this mind”), across four steps: Principle, Purpose, Pressing Forward, and Pursue.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.22cm}

{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 四步骨幹}\qquad{\itshape\footnotesize\color{CoverGoldBright} The Four-Step Spine}

