② & 目的 \textit{\color{CoverCream}Purpose — have this mind of Christ} & {\footnotesize\color{CoverMuted} 2:1-30}\\[0.12em]
③ & 竭力向前 \textit{\color{CoverCream}Pressing Forward — toward the goal} & {\footnotesize\color{CoverMuted} 3:1-21}\\[0.12em]
④ & 追求 \textit{\color{CoverCream}Pursue — the peace and the God of peace} & {\footnotesize\color{CoverMuted} 4:1-23}\\
